{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584330/extras/f164dedc42623e57aa517859597818bb.poster.avif?t=1770270194\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584330/extras/f164dedc42623e57aa517859597818bb.webm?t=1770270194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584330/extras/f164dedc42623e57aa517859597818bb.mp4?t=1770270194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a Word-Warlock and vanquish your enemies by conjuring the arcane through spelling. Test your keyboard sorcery against foe and obstacle alike.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wordlock is a typing game which tasks the player with spelling out  words to cast spells. Throughout levels you'll face a variety of enemies and enter encounters which puts a new challenge on how you navigate typing on your keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wordlock plays like a mix of topdown action roguelikes and typing test games where players must switch between dodging enemy attacks with WASD and executing specific spells/effects by typing out specific words on the screen.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through a series of linear levels with a variety of gameplay styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoring based off of typing speed and precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable difficulty to allow players of all typing skills to enjoy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full original soundtrack to fuel the frenetic keyboard mayhem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of spells each with their own word prompts and effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584330/extras/8e9ec5a1083270fd9bdba15e6f8b929e.poster.avif?t=1770270194\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584330/extras/8e9ec5a1083270fd9bdba15e6f8b929e.webm?t=1770270194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584330/extras/8e9ec5a1083270fd9bdba15e6f8b929e.mp4?t=1770270194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584330?t=1770270194","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584330?t=1770270194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584330/a681952c7355b69f3e42f49189b287ba17165f76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770270194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584330/a681952c7355b69f3e42f49189b287ba17165f76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770270194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4122940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584330/extras/f164dedc42623e57aa517859597818bb.poster.avif?t=1770270194\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584330/extras/f164dedc42623e57aa517859597818bb.webm?t=1770270194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://sh